  "unresolved": [
    "Exact physical mechanism producing orientation-dependent low-speed resistance: runtime wheel/contact forces, effective joint drive response and solver/contact behavior have not been measured separately.",
    "Authored caster zero-friction patch exists. Static body/wheel collision bounds do not indicate a bed hit; runtime arm contact is not fully reconstructed. Heading-only station experiment weakens bed-position-only explanation.",
    "CPU/GPU affect wall FPS and ROS-wall/simulation timing. Both backends have failures, so neither a CPU-only defect nor equal backend reliability is established.",
    "New fixed-command experiments reproduce resistance and PI saturation, not the complete original Nav2 overshoot trajectory."
  ],
  "recommended_next_step_ko": "D-027 후속 방향: 실패 조건과 허용치를 유지한다. 실물 회전 명령·측정 속도·잔류 회전량과 시뮬을 비교해 모델 타당성을 확인하고, 현실적인 지연·포화·제동 편차에서 공통 감속/정지 완료 계약을 검증한다. 시뮬 PI만 바꾸어 성공시키는 것을 해결로 간주하지 않는다. 좁은 구간 자동 재정렬은 회전 공간 검증 없이 추가하지 않는다.",
